  "description": "They’re tired of “kid stuff,” and they’re ready for a new adventure. Sesh offers uncompromised professional quality and deliberate design choices tailored for the next generation of shredders. Built with a durable steel frame and reinforced with thick dropouts, Sesh has the same resilience your grom brings to every ride. At its core, this entry-level BMX bike packs a punch with professional-grade features, including a 3-piece crank, 25x9T compact gearing, and axle pegs – just like their favorite pro’s bike. Thoughtful safety features like extra-long handlebars, a reliable & snag-free U brake, precise threadless steering, and wide, shock-absorbing tires keep their ride safe and nervous parents at ease. Sesh is edgy, exciting, and undeniably bad@$$. It's not just what kids want; it's what they'd choose for themselves.",
